[{"answer":"Good evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Tonight's show comes to you from the Good Home Exhibition in Duke's Court,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/2.mp3"},{"answer":"where we've been trying out some of the latest gadgets on show here","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and getting our resident expert - Liz Shearer -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/4.mp3"},{"answer":"to tell us which ones are worth buying and which will die a death.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, John, I've been investigating four new household gadgets","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and sorting out the advantages and disadvantages","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and then really deciding what are 'Must buys',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/9.mp3"},{"answer":"what are 'Maybe buys' and what are 'Never buys'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start with this vacuum flask for keeping drinks hot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt this had quite a lot going for it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/12.mp3"},{"answer":"most of all is the fact that it contains no glass","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and is therefore unbreakable to all intents and purposes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/14.mp3"},{"answer":"It's made of stainless steel which is guaranteed for 20 years...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/15.mp3"},{"answer":"hope that's long enough...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's true what the manufacturer claims","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/17.mp3"},{"answer":"that it does maintain heat for 18 hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's pretty good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/19.mp3"},{"answer":"On the down side, it really works out to be quite expensive","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and, much more surprisingly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/21.mp3"},{"answer":"it unfortunately leaves a strange taste...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/22.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, when you've drunk from it...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/23.mp3"},{"answer":"so all in all, my recommendation would be it's got plenty of advantages,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is rather expensive so I'd say you should maybe buy it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Moving on to a natty little device...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/26.mp3"},{"answer":"the Whistle Key Holder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Basically this is where you whistle","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and the key holder gives off a high pitched noise and flashes light","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/29.mp3"},{"answer":"so you can find it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/30.mp3"},{"answer":"One advantage of this model is that it also has a small light.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/31.mp3"},{"answer":"You press the button and this means you can find keyholes easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I also felt the small size was a real advantage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/33.mp3"},{"answer":"On the weaker side, I did find the noise unpleasant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Which I'm sure the designers could have done something about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And I found that it didn't work through metal, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/36.mp3"},{"answer":"it's mainly used for finding in coat pockets, cushions, etc.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/37.mp3"},{"answer":"But taken as a whole I thought it was a masterpiece of design","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and would highly recommend it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/39.mp3"},{"answer":"The third gizmo is called the Army Flashlight","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/40.mp3"},{"answer":"because it was developed initially for military use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/41.mp3"},{"answer":"It works by squeezing the handle to generate the power.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Its advantages are that it can be used for outside activities,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and also... and, this is one of the surprising features...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/44.mp3"},{"answer":"it does work underwater.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/45.mp3"},{"answer":"My main objection to it though was, although it did work in these conditions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/46.mp3"},{"answer":"this model gave off a weak light.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/47.mp3"},{"answer":"So my recommendation I'm afraid would have to be to avoid this one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/48.mp3"},{"answer":"The decoy camera was last on my list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/49.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a fake video camera which you fix to your wall to scare off burglars.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/50.mp3"},{"answer":"The advantage of this model is something which makes it look very realistic...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/51.mp3"},{"answer":"its flashing light.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/52.mp3"},{"answer":"On the down side, it was quite difficult to fix to the wall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/53.mp3"},{"answer":"However, burglary is such a major problem these days that it is worth the effort, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/54.mp3"},{"answer":"this gets my strong recommendation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. Thanks for that, Liz.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-4-part-2-2023-08-20-18-52-47/56.mp3"}]
